{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object approached, pick it up, check properties, perform task, move and finish. Else, approach or scan.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = PickupObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsTaskComplete    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    />\"",
